From: ThirdReality <dev@3reality.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: w1: skip the vif tx queue in nsta_free() when the vif is gone

nsta_free() already treats sta->sta_wnet_vif as possibly NULL when it
clears vm_mainsta, but then dereferences it unconditionally to walk
vm_tx_buffer_queue. On rmmod vlsicomm, wifi_mac_StationDetach() frees
stations whose vif has already been torn down, so this takes a spin lock
at NULL + 0x2d34 and Oopses inside rmmod with IRQs disabled:

  Unable to handle kernel paging request at virtual address 0000000000002d34
  pc : _raw_spin_lock_irqsave+0x5c/0x8c
  lr : nsta_free+0xd4/0x2bc [vlsicomm]
   nsta_free / wifi_mac_StationDetach / wifi_mac_cap_detach /
   wifi_mac_mac_exit / drv_dev_remove / hal_exit_priv / aml_rmmod

Seen on TRHub-V3L (6.6.129, W155S1 v1.8.3.3) during resetupwifi.sh
reload. The vif's tx queue is destroyed with the vif, so there is nothing
left to purge for this station; just skip it.
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/w1/vmac/wifi_mac_sta.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/w1/vmac/wifi_mac_sta.c
@@ -751,18 +751,21 @@
         FREE(sta->sta_wai_ie,"sta->sta_wai_ie");
 #endif /*CONFIG_WAPI*/
 
-    txqueue = &wnet_vif->vm_tx_buffer_queue;
-    WIFINET_SAVEQ_LOCK(txqueue);
-    skb_queue_walk_safe(txqueue,skb,tmp) {
-        txqueue_sta = os_skb_get_nsta(skb);
-        if (txqueue_sta == sta) {
-            AML_OUTPUT("as free sta: %p so free skb\n",txqueue_sta);
-            aml_skb_unlink(skb,txqueue);
-            wifi_mac_free_skb(skb);
+    /* The vif may already be gone on driver unload; its tx queue went with it. */
+    if (wnet_vif) {
+        txqueue = &wnet_vif->vm_tx_buffer_queue;
+        WIFINET_SAVEQ_LOCK(txqueue);
+        skb_queue_walk_safe(txqueue,skb,tmp) {
+            txqueue_sta = os_skb_get_nsta(skb);
+            if (txqueue_sta == sta) {
+                AML_OUTPUT("as free sta: %p so free skb\n",txqueue_sta);
+                aml_skb_unlink(skb,txqueue);
+                wifi_mac_free_skb(skb);
 
+            }
         }
+        WIFINET_SAVEQ_UNLOCK(txqueue);
     }
-    WIFINET_SAVEQ_UNLOCK(txqueue);
 
     WIFINET_SAVEQ_DESTROY(&(sta->sta_pstxqueue));
     pr_debug("%s free %p\n", __func__, sta);
-- 
